    "items": [
      {
        "desc": "DSM 7 does not let third-party packages run as root, and ZeroTier needs a network capability. zerotier-one solves it without any other package: it creates one boot-up task, run by root, that prepares the system, gives ZeroTier the capability after every install or upgrade, and restarts the service if it stops. DSM asks for your password to create a task that runs as root."
      },
      {
        "type": "multiselect",
        "subitems": [
